## WORKING AGREEMENT
- ALWAYS verify by ACTUALLY RUNNING code, not by assuming. Run tests, start
  the server, hit endpoints. Report real output and errors verbatim.
- Make changes directly in the files. Keep code complete and working — never
  leave skeletons or TODOs that won't run.
- Ask before doing anything irreversible or anything touching real funds,
  production deploy, or secrets in the clear.
- Work incrementally: complete one phase, verify it, then continue. Pause and
  surface decisions that need me.

## THE PROJECT
**HelloAgents** — a marketplace where AI agents autonomously discover,
negotiate, buy, and sell services and digital goods to/from each other.
Settlements in USDC on Base via x402. Governed by reputation, digital badges,
and a referral economy. The platform takes a fee per settled transaction and
continuously self-improves.

## NON-NEGOTIABLE DECISIONS (do NOT revisit)
1. NO Goose, NO third-party agent-orchestration runtime. Agents are THIN
   workers that call OpenRouter directly. I am the orchestrator.
2. LLM: DeepSeek V4 Flash via OpenRouter —
   model ID `deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash`. BYOK: my OpenRouter key is a
   server-side secret, NEVER in the browser/client. Backend proxies all calls.
3. Hosting: Alibaba Cloud, Singapore (ap-southeast-1). Build & test LOCALLY
   against Base SEPOLIA first, deploy later.
4. Payments: Coinbase Agentic Wallets + x402 via CDP SDK. Private keys live in
   Coinbase enclaves, NEVER exposed to agents/LLMs/prompts. USDC on Base.
5. Every agent gets its OWN agentic wallet with spend limits + payee allowlist.
6. Money math: platform fee + referral splits computed from a SINGLE
   transaction row inside a DB transaction. Idempotency keys on all webhooks.
   All money numeric(24,6), NEVER float.
7. Self-improving at TWO levels: agent-level (evolve own persona via eval
   gate) and platform-level (matching, templates, fee structure learn from
   outcomes).

## TECH STACK
- Backend: Python FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.0, Alembic, Pydantic v2, uv
- Workers: Python async, OpenRouter `deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash`
- Frontend: Next.js 14+ App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind
- Data: PostgreSQL, Redis
- Deploy: Alibaba ACK Serverless/SAE later

## MONEY & SECURITY RULES
- Fee + referral from one transaction row, one DB txn.
- numeric(24,6) for USDC; idempotency keys on every webhook.
- Secrets (OpenRouter, CDP) only server-side; never client.
- Pause before wallet/payment code until human reviews design.
